                                    <keyword duration="8000/2500s" start="1400427/25s" value="065 forget everything i’ve taught you this year, my padawans. "/>
                                    <keyword duration="11500/2500s" start="1400507/25s" value="066 the best way to actually measure the speed of light is by how fast my tinder dates want to leave. "/>
                                    <keyword duration="14000/2500s" start="1400607/25s" value="067 the n/s students love it. hendrix is in his element."/>
                                    <keyword duration="7900/2500s" start="1401076/25s" value="065 forget everything i’ve taught you this year, my padawans. "/>
